{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I encountered a comically unexpected translation error recently.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/5c25049fa7fe62b8f05e791270f00ef662fbe8d8458a9138abe76b420cb7ff88.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 2.38], [6, 2.38, 2.68], [7, 2.68, 3.1]]}, {"text": "English is rapidly becoming the language of the Earth, even though it is difficult to learn and has many unclear situations depending on your English proficiency or cultural background.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/94c4d8cb3764e68bc14241d47e0e6e4398c4201b3433ec8d6717618761cf4ab8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.44], [9, 2.66, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.02], [11, 3.02, 3.1], [12, 3.1, 3.22], [13, 3.22, 3.5], [14, 3.5, 3.78], [15, 3.78, 4.0], [16, 4.0, 4.22], [17, 4.22, 4.34], [18, 4.34, 4.62], [19, 4.62, 4.98], [20, 4.98, 5.58], [21, 5.58, 5.96], [22, 5.96, 6.22], [23, 6.22, 6.36], [24, 6.36, 6.56], [25, 6.56, 7.2], [26, 7.2, 7.46], [27, 7.46, 7.86], [28, 7.86, 8.32]]}, {"text": "In a professional environment, we expect coworkers and customers to behave professionally using professional language.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/5927a3a1fd99334c9e2bf058a41ac43044e8858a510619364be544b774cc5a2e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.24], [2, 0.24, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 1.26], [4, 1.52, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.98], [7, 2.46, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 3.06], [9, 3.06, 3.34], [10, 3.34, 3.6], [11, 3.6, 4.18], [12, 4.18, 4.7], [13, 4.7, 5.14], [14, 5.14, 5.56]]}, {"text": "But across cultures, words and phrases can have different meeanings.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/01c2126bf41f4fb70e1d022821cd1fb0af4bb1a6093b9f7fe7a9b8b096edeee3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.9], [3, 1.24, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.94], [6, 1.94, 2.28], [7, 2.28, 2.48], [8, 2.48, 2.8]]}, {"text": "A classic example is an interview with a British television host discussing a job opportunity in the USA.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/b258cc11de582474e08ed6d754e47d0bda0db68e9136d2d9616a32bb8ce9175f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 1.0], [3, 1.0, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.02], [8, 2.1, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.3], [11, 3.3, 3.94], [12, 3.94, 4.2], [13, 4.2, 4.38], [14, 4.38, 5.0], [15, 5.0, 5.38], [16, 5.38, 5.5], [17, 5.5, 5.8]]}, {"text": "Last year, I encountered this situation several times in real-life scenarios where a driver and passenger struggled to communicate during a pickup.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/717a8d2942981231bbbe3ea31855ae05622497097011bd273802dcffaff4e9d3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.16], [5, 1.38, 1.94], [6, 1.94, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.76], [8, 2.76, 2.96], [10, 3.28, 3.76], [11, 3.76, 4.04], [12, 4.04, 4.16], [13, 4.16, 4.38], [14, 4.38, 4.6], [15, 4.6, 5.0], [17, 5.38, 5.58], [18, 5.58, 6.0], [19, 6.0, 6.32], [20, 6.32, 6.46], [21, 6.46, 6.68]]}, {"text": "Passenger (who presumably learned English as their 2nd or 3rd language) would message the driver, intending them to send a message when the driver arrives at the pickup location:", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/0950b17b16129b9cb01deb8b3b8c05789551c4fcfcd389b52d827cffecb6f071.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.48, 1.02], [2, 1.02, 1.46], [4, 1.88, 2.18], [5, 2.18, 2.44], [6, 2.44, 2.58], [10, 3.28, 3.62], [11, 3.62, 4.26], [12, 4.26, 4.58], [13, 4.58, 4.82], [14, 4.82, 5.12], [15, 5.34, 5.68], [16, 5.68, 5.9], [17, 5.9, 6.04], [18, 6.04, 6.2], [20, 6.34, 6.6], [21, 6.6, 6.78], [22, 6.78, 6.88], [23, 6.88, 7.16], [24, 7.16, 7.56], [25, 7.56, 7.7], [26, 7.7, 7.8], [27, 7.8, 8.04], [28, 8.04, 8.52]]}, {"text": "passenger: massage me when you get here", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/3fb10f3657d2441baf11285fd9b6216d3393894e7046b30e82456bd7750cccdd.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.66, 1.34], [2, 1.34, 1.58], [3, 1.58, 1.72], [4, 1.72, 1.82], [5, 1.82, 1.96], [6, 1.96, 2.26]]}, {"text": "To a native English speaker, this is unprofessional sexual harassment.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/9fc75ebe99f36a26725bc259723c5d131178446c9a8f007167f0ed77b5baea90.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.2], [5, 1.38, 1.52], [6, 1.52, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.84], [9, 2.84, 3.24]]}, {"text": "Passengers should not request personal favors from their rideshare drivers", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/17958a01708d8417ea7120788076479e7e39e4591fc9c39e5d9dca23999c624e.mp3"}, {"text": "But maybe, this was just an unintentional misspelling.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/9296a66acb53d5bc458c6bd5a65db1e51a95d28185d213a87fb5b995a147c7c9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.56]]}, {"text": "But what if the passenger sends:", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d22b6d51cfeb269592d50dd04379775ccee54d3aa513cfcb98c157e8b47060ad.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.54], [4, 0.54, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.42]]}, {"text": "passenger: when you cum, massage me", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d220242de1553ad90071eb50bb100445be14e8fcf54206d0137dd791b5d75346.mp3"}, {"text": "Is this a high intentional sexual harassment or is this person uncomfortably bad at English?", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/be1925954c0d0fc319a9002120f985326a11244351b855ebd3c6d93d931725be.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.54], [8, 2.54, 2.7], [9, 2.7, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.92], [12, 3.92, 4.3], [13, 4.3, 4.48], [14, 4.48, 4.78]]}, {"text": "In the context of this being in a country with many non-native English speakers, the author is likely someone who learned English by listening and learned spelling by sounding out words.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/55b4bdd4b736c28fcbf77dd28d1dba2c44cedf1b5afce0f3c547c493d75585e9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.36], [7, 1.36, 1.44], [8, 1.44, 1.76], [9, 1.76, 2.06], [10, 2.06, 2.38], [12, 2.92, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.86], [14, 4.3, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.64], [16, 4.64, 4.86], [17, 4.86, 5.1], [18, 5.1, 5.48], [19, 5.48, 5.72], [21, 5.92, 6.24], [22, 6.24, 6.46], [23, 6.46, 6.8], [24, 6.8, 7.14], [26, 7.38, 7.8], [27, 7.8, 8.1], [28, 8.1, 8.44], [29, 8.44, 8.68], [30, 8.68, 8.94]]}, {"text": "But if this was sent in a native speaking country, this would be considered Sexual Harassment.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/651722ead5fcdc96562784a365bd6e5757176cb6d2161cee6c3b7a2d83544dbc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.58], [4, 0.58, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 1.0], [6, 1.0, 1.1], [7, 1.1, 1.3], [8, 1.3, 1.6], [9, 1.6, 2.08], [10, 2.54, 2.72], [11, 2.72, 2.84], [12, 2.84, 2.96], [13, 2.96, 3.4], [14, 3.4, 3.86], [15, 3.86, 4.34]]}, {"text": "Content moderation is hard.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c70603e227b31698b1093f24b426565b3f2c50c3a3f275042627b8e19e7023be.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.86], [2, 0.86, 1.14], [3, 1.14, 1.44]]}, {"text": "In English-speaking countries like the USA, Canada, or England, these messages would likely be deemed offensive", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/17ce436e48dbae6c30043bf6d50d18bc20551dbdf978df63f85f559f31e9b475.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [2, 0.76, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 1.7], [5, 1.7, 1.96], [6, 2.56, 2.78], [7, 2.78, 3.1], [8, 3.1, 3.5], [9, 4.08, 4.18], [10, 4.18, 4.58], [11, 4.58, 4.86], [12, 4.86, 5.1], [13, 5.1, 5.32], [14, 5.32, 5.5], [15, 5.5, 5.96]]}, {"text": "In a language-diverse country like Singapore or Thailand, messages like this are just part of everyday business.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/b2622cf5791229d7f6639ea95b3c75cf1dd640395fbe56fea23cb5a9ec2c0e6c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.3], [3, 0.96, 1.46], [4, 1.46, 1.7], [5, 1.7, 2.12], [6, 2.12, 2.58], [7, 2.58, 3.0], [8, 3.58, 3.8], [9, 3.8, 4.06], [10, 4.06, 4.28], [11, 4.28, 4.52], [12, 4.52, 4.7], [13, 4.7, 4.94], [14, 4.94, 5.1], [15, 5.1, 5.4], [16, 5.4, 5.8]]}, {"text": "Even English teachers can teach the wrong pronunciation of words, as seen in this classic", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/71914db572ff2dec8a9e06f79a80de9d5c2de9d722dcb8578681264607d9264c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 2.26], [8, 2.26, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 2.94], [10, 2.94, 3.24], [11, 3.24, 3.42], [12, 3.42, 3.54], [13, 3.54, 3.7], [14, 3.7, 4.08]]}, {"text": "If you have any comments, send me an email kevin@sparkstart.io", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../../../assets/blog-audio/ddd80197db918a1bad928912c969ab5443fea295adadf216eaea978a0ab68e60.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.62], [4, 0.62, 0.98], [5, 1.24, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.54], [7, 1.54, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.96]]}]}